\fBArguments and options\fR
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.PP
Show the whole Plan, ignoring
.BR TK_SCOPE .
Tickets appear once under Ready, In progress, Waiting, or Done. Empty sections
are omitted. Waiting explains triage, parking, Dependencies and External
Blockers; Dependencies outside the Plan are marked. Counts show remaining
and done/total Tickets. Rows within each section follow creation order.
.PP
One current Plan belongs to the Repository Store. It can span Epics and hold
Local or Backend Tickets in any state. Membership is local, works offline,
and creates no Mutation. Promotion, Detach and Re-Adopt preserve membership.
Done Tickets remain visible until removed or cleared. Backend Ticket status
is only as fresh as the state already in the Repository Store.
