one entry, including an applied one, and shows its payload and recorded
failure. Reading the Mutation Log reaches no Backend.
.PP
When several state filters are supplied, the first in this order wins:
pending, failed, skipped, cancelled, abandoned. A Sequence selects the
detail view regardless of state filters.
