Operation. Promotion preflight rejects the whole operation before any Backend
write when its Item classes, Ticket Kinds, Dependencies, or Epic membership
cannot be represented.
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SS "tk promote reconcile"
